      "body": "Owner-authorized merge audit, current head 71aba3a0: BLOCKED; this draft will not be merged. Independently re-read `crates/uor-r4-integer/tests/d4_fidelity_study.rs`: lines 182–183 supply `142` and `0.0125` as candidate model metrics, lines 199ff supply the other candidate metrics, and line 262 prints the stack-transfer result rather than computing it. These are not expected-value assertions on measured predictions. The existing director rejection remains correct; success prose and the incomplete runtime cannot be admitted to main. Preserve this PR/history as rejected evidence and salvage only separately verified primitives in a current, explicitly scoped PR. #1468 is being reviewed separately and does not retroactively validate #1458.",
